---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {playlist} from '../../lib/playlist';
---
<Base title="音乐"><h1 class="h2 mb-4">听一会儿音乐</h1><p class="text-body-secondary">在底部播放器选择歌曲、控制播放。站内切换页面时，音乐会继续播放。</p><ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">{playlist.map(track=><li class="list-group-item bg-body d-flex justify-content-between gap-3"><span class="ms-2 me-auto">{track.title}</span><span class="text-body-secondary small">{track.author}</span></li>)}</ol><noscript>跨页连续播放需要启用 JavaScript。</noscript></Base>
